cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this artifact or its data, please cite the ACSAC 2026 paper below.
title: >-
  Brave New Browsing! Tracker Exposure under Browser-Agent Delegation (artifact)
abstract: >-
  Research artifact for the ACSAC 2026 paper "Brave New Browsing! Tracker
  Exposure under Browser-Agent Delegation". Ships the measurement pipeline,
  the released per-session data, and the analysis that regenerates the paper's
  tables and figures: a matched human-versus-agent user study (22 participants,
  10 WebVoyager tasks), a per-agent dose-response analysis over the 643-task
  WebVoyager benchmark, a tool-schema and proxy action-space ablation, and a
  cross-benchmark check on Online Mind2Web.
type: software
